gYh(){return"PRIVACY POLICY\n\nWe are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring the security of your personal information. This policy outlines how we collect, use, and protect your data when you use our appointment management application.\n\nDATA COLLECTION:\n\u2022 We collect only the data necessary to provide our services\n\u2022 Appointment details (date, time, service type, client information) are stored locally\n\u2022 Business information is used exclusively for appointment management\n\u2022 We do not collect analytics, browsing history, or behavioral data\n\u2022 Optional features may request additional permissions (calendar, notifications)\n\nDATA USAGE:\n\u2022 Your data is never shared with third parties without explicit consent\n\u2022 All data remains on your device unless you choose to export or sync it\n\u2022 We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information\n\u2022 Data is used solely to deliver and improve our services\\n\u2022 You have full control over your data at all times\n\nDATA SECURITY:\n\u2022 All data is encrypted using industry-standard algorithms\n\u2022 We employ secure storage practices to protect your information\n\u2022 Regular security updates and patches are provided\n\u2022 Access controls ensure only authorized users can view data\n\u2022 We follow GDPR and international privacy standards\n\nYOUR RIGHTS:\n\u2022 You can access, modify, or delete your data at any time\n\u2022 You can export your data in standard formats\n\u2022 You can revoke permissions and opt-out of features\n\u2022 You have the right to data portability and erasure\n\nCONTACT US:\\nFor questions about this privacy policy:\nsupporto@fdconsultingsrl.com\n\n\xa9 2025 - All rights reserved.\nDeveloped by FD Consulting Srl\nVAT: 04157171200\nsupporto@fdconsultingsrl.com"},
gZw(){return"TERMS OF SERVICE\n\nBy using this application, you agree to the following terms and conditions:\n\nLICENSE GRANT:\n\u2022 This app is licensed for personal and commercial use\n\u2022 You receive a non-exclusive, non-transferable license\n\u2022 You may not reverse engineer, decompile, or redistribute the app\n\u2022 Updates and improvements may be provided at our discretion\n\nPERMITTED USE:\n\u2022 Use the app responsibly and in compliance with applicable laws\n\u2022 Do not attempt to circumvent security measures\n\u2022 Do not use the app for illegal or unauthorized purposes\n\u2022 Report any bugs, vulnerabilities, or security issues promptly\n\nINTELLECTUAL PROPERTY:\n\u2022 All content, features, and functionality are owned by FD Consulting Srl\n\u2022 You may not copy, modify, or create derivative works\n\u2022 Trademarks and logos remain the property of their respective owners\n\nLIMITATION OF LIABILITY:\n\u2022 The app is provided 'as is' without warranties of any kind\n\u2022 We are not liable for any data loss, damages, or business interruption\n\u2022 Use of the app is at your own risk\n\u2022 We do not guarantee uninterrupted or error-free operation\n\nTERMINATION:\n\u2022 We reserve the right to terminate access for violations of these terms\n\u2022 You may stop using the app at any time\n\u2022 Upon termination, you must cease all use of the application\n\nCHANGES TO TERMS:\n\u2022 We may modify these terms at any time\n\u2022 Continued use constitutes acceptance of modified terms\n\u2022 Material changes will be communicated through the app\n\nGOVERNING LAW:\n\u2022 These terms are governed by Italian law\n\u2022 Disputes shall be resolved in the courts of Italy\n\nCONTACT:\nFor questions regarding these terms:\nsupporto@fdconsultingsrl.com\n\n\xa9 2025 - All rights reserved.\nDeveloped by FD Consulting Srl\nVAT: 04157171200\nsupporto@fdconsultingsrl.com"},
